# Design System

## Color Palette (Strict)

Use only these colors. No other colors allowed.

| Role | Hex | Usage |
|------|-----|-------|
| Dark | #0a0a0a | Page background |
| Dark | #111111 | Card/panel background |
| Dark | #1a1a1a | Input, button background |
| Grey | #333333 | Borders, dividers |
| Grey | #555555 | Secondary borders |
| Grey | #888888 | Secondary text, muted |
| Grey | #aaaaaa | Tertiary text |
| White | #ffffff | Primary text |
| Blue | #3b82f6 | Highlight, active state, links |

## Rules

- **Dark theme only**: No light mode. Remove `prefers-color-scheme: light` media queries.
- **No emojis**: Do not use emoji characters in UI text or copy.
- **No focus highlight**: Remove all `:focus`, `:focus-visible`, `outline` styles. Use `outline: none` where needed.
- **No colored icons**: Icons must use dark, white, or grey. Blue only for active/highlight state.
- **No other colors**: No red, green, yellow, purple, etc. Only dark, white, grey, blue.

## CSS Variables

```css
:root {
  --color-bg: #0a0a0a;
  --color-surface: #111111;
  --color-input: #1a1a1a;
  --color-border: #333333;
  --color-border-light: #555555;
  --color-muted: #888888;
  --color-text: #ffffff;
  --color-highlight: #3b82f6;
}
```

## Examples

```css
/* Bad */
button:focus { outline: 2px solid blue; }
.error { color: red; }

/* Good */
button:focus { outline: none; }
.error { color: #888888; }
```
